codex
The claim structure is mutually recursive, as intended for reachability circularities: the original full claim set closes quickly, and the base recursive `prime-from` claim also closes alone. An extra reviewer experiment that filtered out supporting claims made the dependent `prime` proof no longer complete promptly, so I stopped that non-equivalent diagnostic; it does not alter the successful all-claims reconstruction and will be documented as such.
