  ✓ Check program fidelity and run independent Python differential tests
  ✓ Rebuild semantics/proof from clean sources and execute all positive claims
  ✓ Audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and every local K rule
  → Create and run a fresh false non-vacuity mutation
  • Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md with verdict
