+| `solution.mpy` construct | Declaration | Executing rules |
+|---|---|---|
+| `Module`, six `FuncDef`s, parameters and statement lists | syntax lines 8-16 | H1-H6, O2-O4 |
+| `Return`, `If` | syntax lines 11-13 | O5-O8 |
